{"id":1158,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><div><p>2023年2月22日，我院在学生科办公室召开北京航天二院某所招聘宣讲会，学院党委副书记贾鹏、辅导员班主任及符合招聘要求的学生参加了本场宣讲会。宣讲会中，招聘单位代表对公司基本情况作了介绍，详细介绍了招聘岗位，与每位同学进行了交流，随后在东区训练馆对篮球专项学生进行了专业技能测试，并与部分学生达成就业意向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FnRf9VLmUiU4-8LAmCbM8laLm6VL4C1aUzrVL4TfU4vDM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVMSy8oky4UNMkU4lDLNLYoRW7Ul7iUNUZMzf7MmQ2UmQFnz-YUl-4nmMFLzT7nm9Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47PL4GZgtA8pUmcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=11308&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2E5483BCBC562C282DAA5BD850D66FB6/E22AB3F3/19DF8\" vheight=\" 550px\" vwidth=\" 800px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FMmC9DL4vZLRr7nA77bM46RMmvbUmT1RLzUbUNQ7M4UsLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy8L1yZMYh7Ul7PozlZol-bU8UPnl78MRNDoRTfM8LiL4nFMNVfozQVnNQFLmnVnmNYgtXaQ4Oeo4x8_5AbgDTJQty0LzG8oSyPLzLaokbw62m8c&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=11308&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></div></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://tyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=FnRf9VLmUiU4-8LAmCbM8laLm6VL4C1aUzrVL4TfU4vDM4G0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVMSy8oky4UNMkU4lDLNLYoRW7Ul7iUNUZMzf7MmQ2UmQFnz-YUl-4nmMFLzT7nm9Jqjfjo4Oeosnb_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUbg47PL4GZgtA8pUmcc&oid=1054562613&tid=1049&nid=11308&e=.jpg"}